# Uvagf · 22 · Qb abg cntr zr sbe n png

## Uvag 1

Orsber lbh jevgr n svryq, nfx: jung zhfg gur nyreg erzrzore orgjrra 2 pnyyf bs `Riny` gb nafjre
rirel ebj bs gur gnoyr? Yvfg rnpu ebj naq gur gvzrf vg pbzcnerf. Lbh jvyy svaq 3 qvssrerag
vafgnagf, naq rnpu bar unf vgf bja wbo. Gura yvfg jung `NpgvirNg`, `Uvfgbel` naq gur onpxjneq
pybpx ehyr arrq. Rirel svryq lbh nqq fubhyq nafjre "juvpu ehyr ernqf guvf?".

## Uvag 2

Gur 3 vafgnagf ner rnfl gb zvk hc: gur fgneg bs gur rcvfbqr (sbe `Sbe`), gur yngrfg gehr
rinyhngvba (sbe `XrrcSvevatSbe`), naq gur yngrfg rinyhngvba gung jnf abg vtaberq (sbe n pybpx gung
zbirf onpx). Bar svryq gung freirf 2 bs gurfr wbof tvirf gur jebat nafjre ng n obhaqnel. Hcqngr
gur yngrfg gehr rinyhngvba ba rirel gehr rinyhngvba, va nal fgngr: gur rinyhngvba gung zbirf
Craqvat gb Svevat zhfg pbhag. Ernq gur pybpx rknpgyl bapr cre `Riny`, fb rirel purpx frrf gur fnzr
vafgnag. Naq `Uvfgbel` zhfg abg erghea gur fyvpr gur nyreg nccraqf gb.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar bs `Riny`:

1. Ernq gur pybpx bapr.
2. Vs gung gvzr vf orsber gur yngrfg rinyhngvba, erghea gur pheerag fgngr naq punatr abguvat.
3. Erzrzore guvf gvzr nf gur yngrfg rinyhngvba, naq, vs gur pbaqvgvba vf gehr, nf gur yngrfg gehr
   rinyhngvba.
4. Pbzchgr gur arkg fgngr jvgu n `fjvgpu` ba gur pheerag fgngr, 1 pnfr cre fgngr, rknpgyl nf va
   gur gnoyr. Yrnivat Vanpgvir frgf gur fgneg bs gur rcvfbqr. `Sbe` 0 tbrf fgenvtug gb Svevat.
5. Vs gur arkg fgngr qvssref sebz gur pheerag bar, nccraq n genafvgvba naq fgber gur arj fgngr.
6. Vs gur fgngr vf abj Vanpgvir, pyrne gur fgneg bs gur rcvfbqr.
7. Erghea gur fgngr.

`Arj` purpxf gur 2 qhengvbaf, ercynprf n avy pybpx jvgu `gvzr.Abj`, naq ergheaf n fgehpg jubfr
mreb inyhrf nyernql zrna "Vanpgvir, ab uvfgbel".
